            "Roaring-Sea Caves":"Grutas Sonamar","Rock Peak Ruins":"Ruinas Pico Roca","Iron Ruins":"Ruinas Hierro",
            "Iceberg Ruins":"Ruinas Iceberg","Split-Decision Ruins":"Ruinas del Dilema","Lakeside Cave":"Gruta del Lago",
